{"title":"2021 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problem 1</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A company sells rectangular business cards. Each card has dimensions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/3/773364718d825a37e31cda99985c2e0ca46e0730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\text{ cm} \\times 9 \\text{ cm}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"96\" height=\"15\" />. Cards are printed on a page and then the page is cut to produce the individual cards.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Parts\">Parts</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Parts\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1a\" title=\"2021 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a\">2021 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1a</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1b\" title=\"2021 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b\">2021 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1b</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_Fryer_Problems/Problem_1c&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c (page does not exist)\">2021 CEMC Fryer Problems/Problem 1c</a></li></ul>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018014429\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.007 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.012 seconds\nPr